elpa-welkomscherm (1.2.4-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * New `welkomscherm-mode', derived from `special-mode', with its own keymap
    derived from `button-buffer-map' and `special-mode-map'.
  * Refresh the dashboard with `g' instead of `View-goto-line'.
  * New user option `welkomscherm/line-spacing'.
  * Fix `buffer is read-only' error when pressing TAB on the first line.

